{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::overview", "chunk_sha256": "12a03352894ea95fa674cf0c71dc06c3012cc9b9fead3864c5811d444735710f", "content": "本品为婴儿细轴棉签，由棉头和纸轴组成，仅用于外耳廓等外部区域的轻柔清洁。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::before_use", "chunk_sha256": "cb513056982cdba9a32c4b8df82cb67a508f17d51aeff9735fb8a84478e631c2", "content": "使用前检查包装是否完整、棉头是否松脱、纸轴是否弯折。任一异常时不要使用。清洁者应先洗净并擦干双手。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "before_use", "section_title": "使用前检查", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::operation", "chunk_sha256": "caaaed4d2ea447a84a99dcff368822c572d92b864dc72e74f64552782a184abc", "content": "让儿童保持稳定姿势，仅用棉头轻擦看得见的外耳廓部位。每支使用一次，使用后立即丢弃。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "外耳廓清洁方法", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::prohibitions", "chunk_sha256": "a60d4b954c8edbeca31c3d12a16ad09b5830192a3e159fc3fa76d5623cfda580", "content": "不得将棉签伸入耳道，不得在儿童突然移动时继续操作，不得自行蘸酒精、药液或其他不明液体处理耳内问题。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "prohibitions", "section_title": "禁止事项", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "17eb478f00c437533cd185026f0f708e5dedcab0f182f7762f3c99ab1b81eda0", "content": "未使用的棉签应保持包装封闭，存放于干燥处并远离儿童可自行取得的位置。用过的棉签不得重复使用。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存与处置", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1::escalation", "chunk_sha256": "015954429f3cfc4276adcfc4be2612ab72facb0e2a0f5d058595e4948c1cf309", "content": "若出现持续干燥、疼痛、流血、异常分泌物或听力变化，应停止自行清洁并咨询专业医务人员。说明书不提供疾病诊断。", "manual_content_sha256": "9a625839532d9598e19cd9fba39ddb53826bad4298dc82b50092780af48793a0", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-COTTON-SWAB-551", "product_name": "婴儿细轴棉签", "section_id": "escalation", "section_title": "停止使用与就医提示", "sku_id": "FINE-TIP", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000551", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::overview", "chunk_sha256": "d431c4bc15cd6f22239acd9f2850af7726d08a948316c653a3ff322392c63738", "content": "本品为植物纤维制成的婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾，商品记录为无添加香味，可按包装适用范围用于宝宝日常清洁。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::dry_use", "chunk_sha256": "755d317ceb3738578c0a7e4540b8b1ed83eb1288822a9f08c65a8d79775a0247", "content": "从包装中取出单张，用于轻柔吸干水分或擦拭日常可见污渍。不要在同一皮肤部位反复用力摩擦。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "dry_use", "section_title": "干用方法", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::wet_use", "chunk_sha256": "d5c657889950643d3044e324e298d59ecc200cf7fe137a404973211380de1719", "content": "需要湿用时，以洁净的适温水充分润湿单张棉柔巾并轻轻挤去多余水分，再用于日常外部清洁。不得自行加入消毒剂、香精或药液。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "wet_use", "section_title": "湿用方法", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::baby_care", "chunk_sha256": "b3c3acd68cd8c990c0f41a9b638dec255b0379d0f9002318e4e9f7a442ce5646", "content": "清洁宝宝臀部时应由清洁区域向污染区域单向轻擦，必要时更换新的一张；清洁后让皮肤保持干爽。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "baby_care", "section_title": "宝宝臀部清洁", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "78ab059e118128fec509c1fc8f88186014f72ea7bca6188765e935463c8e70a0", "content": "开封后及时封好包装，置于清洁干燥处，避免受潮和污染。本品为一次性用品，使用后放入垃圾桶，不冲入马桶。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存与处置", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1::troubleshooting", "chunk_sha256": "4079775d1b5bb35a122be8cd4db99ee4cef403ae0bb135e387da38ed38c6ac07", "content": "首次使用可先在小范围观察。若出现持续发红、刺痛或其他不适，应停止使用；症状持续时咨询专业医务人员。无添加香味不等于任何人都不会敏感。", "manual_content_sha256": "9df94bad6ec0087f012c400c9405839e86e1e908331033b019493795e5cb67c2", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-DRY-WIPE-589-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-DRY-WIPE-589", "product_name": "婴儿干湿两用棉柔巾", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常情况", "sku_id": "UNSCENTED", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000589", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::overview", "chunk_sha256": "6008e09cb50bdb7dfc8d8793503d2b38027b68712dd86513d43e5b6aefcf68aa", "content": "本品基材为植物纤维无纺布，并非纯棉；商品包装标注可用于婴儿手口日常外部清洁。包装所称“九丝”指包装袋厚度，不是擦巾材质或单张厚度。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "产品介绍", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::before_use", "chunk_sha256": "51c41db4a870aa355d967915a8e16367d1597cc1506ee0a6395acb7e49b618a1", "content": "使用前确认包装密封正常，擦巾没有异味、明显变色或污染。手口清洁前，成人应先清洁双手。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "before_use", "section_title": "使用前检查", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::operation", "chunk_sha256": "69371607a5e17b713d828623515ce786f5c765ce101760b66b1243259c0bfd31", "content": "取出单张后轻柔擦拭手部和口周皮肤。擦拭口周时避开眼睛和口腔内部；污渍较多时更换新的一张，不来回使用已污染的一面。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "手口清洁方法", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::limits", "chunk_sha256": "ab90a1cb22df7834e9d1c559b97f538e2bdda127c5ff2d53cf239e441174ed2f", "content": "“手口适用”仅指包装允许的日常外部清洁，不代表可食用、可用于口腔内部、开放性伤口或替代消毒产品。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "适用边界", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "f6cce76286d0cbc769601d2f2adfdc84b88295f5045bfabf72ffe81db78620a4", "content": "每次取用后立即封口，避免高温、阳光直射和污染。擦巾变干后不要自行添加来源不明的液体继续使用。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "开封后保存", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1::troubleshooting", "chunk_sha256": "076888f414bb946d03536afbf8d2ca90ab01328d83a1473c69adb5b07c3d81d1", "content": "建议首次小范围试用。出现刺激、持续发红或皮肤破损时停止使用；如症状持续，应咨询专业医务人员。", "manual_content_sha256": "135871798aea235cbcf3daf1280743f1f9f4a2c826e65963398020de478661a1", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-HAND-MOUTH-WIPE-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "BABY-PLANT-FIBER-WIPE", "product_name": "婴儿手口清洁巾", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "不适处理", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000138", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::specification", "chunk_sha256": "63eb984991b64b03be4bbed266920bb2664ebf1f204248d7a8963e945ec6791f", "content": "本款尺寸为70×140厘米，采用婴儿可用亲肤面料，适合新生儿洗浴后的包裹和擦干。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "specification", "section_title": "规格与用途", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::first_wash", "chunk_sha256": "476ed32367ccce9363ed19a1838fe8ad6abc3ef2258d50e0ac6d421ba4de4ef0", "content": "首次使用前应单独用清水或婴幼儿衣物适用的温和洗涤剂清洗，充分漂洗后完全晾干。深浅色织物不要混洗。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "first_wash", "section_title": "首次使用", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::drying", "chunk_sha256": "c5485738d0afa294afb8ea8e23e280dd60c45ecaf2f60d31f9e5ee250621331a", "content": "洗浴后先用浴巾包裹身体，再以轻压吸水的方式擦干褶皱部位；不要用力来回摩擦皮肤。使用时确保口鼻不被织物遮挡。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "drying", "section_title": "包裹与擦干", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::laundry", "chunk_sha256": "08c6416c6fde2d8da3a1e8ff3d44f4061f872001cbd0f8137cb56926ee057ea8", "content": "使用后及时清洗并完全晾干。不要长时间湿放，不使用强漂白剂，不与明显污染的衣物混洗。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "laundry", "section_title": "日常清洗", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "e04b491175881ccf8b910ab892b8f196755d770366140d1868f72b624bb8f579", "content": "完全干燥后折叠存放于清洁通风处。长期存放前确认没有潮气，避免密闭保存湿浴巾。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1::troubleshooting", "chunk_sha256": "970082436beb35581ebb9c1ad2e13b99ba9132927761537299cde6284cc66a7b", "content": "若出现持续异味、霉点、明显脱线或粗糙硬化，应停止给婴儿使用。轻微浮毛应先按清洗说明处理，不能据此保证绝对零掉毛。", "manual_content_sha256": "b54b69e034d4c245cd213baf26355897a0393d8f8cde340bb11e0ba02e6b0583", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-BATH-TOWEL-43650034536-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "43650034536", "product_name": "婴儿浴巾", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常处理", "sku_id": "43650034536-70X140", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-TRAIN-000580", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::variants", "chunk_sha256": "adaf4a4a989e6555b59ad0cb220148c886fca39e89b646e88c03a9381bb1960d", "content": "本系列为纯棉纱布用品。4层款更轻薄，6层款为常规吸水款；九月底待产若主要考虑日常吸水性，通常优先6层，最终仍应按具体用途选择。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "variants", "section_title": "款式差异", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::choose", "chunk_sha256": "d95f21db61428e79d267dcf8639185bb273d6d8ddbbf793a212b61f447981837", "content": "用于轻便口水巾等需要快速干燥的场景可考虑4层；用于较强吸水需求可考虑6层。商品记录未规定所有用途，购买前应先确认准备作为哪类用品。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "choose", "section_title": "按用途选择", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::first_wash", "chunk_sha256": "33e8e2e89936156cd7fcf62a629422cee76bef0fe5eb5d0cb3c0335f9f556420", "content": "首次使用前单独清洗，充分漂洗并完全晾干。纱布洗后出现轻微自然褶皱属于结构表现，不应为追求平整而高温熨烫。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "first_wash", "section_title": "首次清洗", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::daily_use", "chunk_sha256": "f76fac6f61413a289c2f43a03ea8f89b660da0a7a93cb2c6af9eb3db450b70b5", "content": "使用时轻压吸水，不在婴儿皮肤上反复用力摩擦。被口水或其他液体明显浸湿后及时更换。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "daily_use", "section_title": "日常使用", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::laundry", "chunk_sha256": "0b1e6c86bdf1facff5f996e22e5fda5463a3faac403812fb8ed9d9c347f0a4b0", "content": "使用温和洗涤方式，不用强漂白剂，不与明显污染物混洗。清洗后展开并在通风处完全晾干。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "laundry", "section_title": "清洗与晾晒", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1::troubleshooting", "chunk_sha256": "bb53e9cf60157bee17098844899715cd66aa5dd96934917388048221402f5c8d", "content": "出现霉点、持续异味、破洞或明显线头松脱时停止使用。不同层数不代表固定季节，也不能仅凭预产月份替代用途判断。", "manual_content_sha256": "53ccad0c8def6727d1a786ecf074837cbb4b4c43d33d90cef247a9e7c6c73152", "manual_id": "MANUAL-BABY-GAUZE-536023110028-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "536023110028", "product_name": "婴儿纱布用品", "section_id": "troubleshooting", "section_title": "异常处理", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000462", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::components", "chunk_sha256": "9133f1b34deb0a17448bc55ea8bc262d2d4401781a65e00dc36f802d07fd40ec", "content": "护理垫用于隔离污物、保护床面；刀纸用于产后清洁。两者用途不同，不能互相替代。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "components", "section_title": "套装组成与用途", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::care_pad", "chunk_sha256": "a2c45e8c849200b0b1eec0e55f5104e6a5fba4d343ac9dfa447cc52059b074d3", "content": "将吸收面朝上、隔水面朝向床面平整铺放。垫面被明显污染、浸湿或移位后应及时更换。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "care_pad", "section_title": "护理垫使用", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::paper", "chunk_sha256": "089a9e774b613fedb124cf2a37394a59d62ea148538cbaa7bd33e5d6759b9af4", "content": "取适量刀纸用于外部清洁，动作应轻柔；每次使用后按护理场所要求处置，不冲入马桶。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "paper", "section_title": "刀纸使用", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::quantity", "chunk_sha256": "395a0909e716d33c9f46b3183239cf7c482dd4fb30f85ce95c319408ee5fe724", "content": "本说明书不规定固定购买数量。应结合医院待产清单、预计住院时间、每包片数或张数，以及医院是否提供相关用品后决定。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "quantity", "section_title": "备货数量", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "913021f384b235c0975d0dd0612b2e0952002124669fac6d4d7d936253eddcd0", "content": "未使用用品应保持包装完整，放在清洁干燥处。开封后避免与已污染用品混放。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "储存", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1::limits", "chunk_sha256": "e38b3a59b742234d39828248ea2214f5a30f9a4c13f78ab875eb12a461aa6645", "content": "本套装是日常护理用品，不提供医疗效果。具体伤口护理、消毒或特殊健康情况应遵循医院和专业医务人员指导。", "manual_content_sha256": "8a811eab50bf61384773d2955ca9a240e8f98f7704ecf9a483a2d5f182672cc6", "manual_id": "MANUAL-MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "MATERNITY-CARE-PAD-SET", "product_name": "护理垫与刀纸", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "使用边界", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TEST-000215", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::selection", "chunk_sha256": "ffdbfcf20a6211e085a5a98dfeb5b8f04143f62ffe9f2e009894e0d599725e54", "content": "茶针适合沿茶饼缝隙细致撬茶，较少破坏茶叶；茶刀适合撬取较大的块状茶。选择主要取决于茶饼紧实程度和目标块度，不只看工具大小。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "selection", "section_title": "工具选择", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::inspection", "chunk_sha256": "5db317434b474b752f300178c1acec7c1ca3a798f861f7192cf38e63d2f6f58c", "content": "检查尖端、刀体和手柄连接处是否完好。若有松动、裂纹、明显锈蚀或保护套破损，应停止使用。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "inspection", "section_title": "使用前检查", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::operation", "chunk_sha256": "c41df185add1a141dd2061732fb17dcd185abf269a3297b478f99d3fafcf8915", "content": "将茶饼放在稳定防滑的平面，从侧面可见缝隙缓慢插入工具，尖端始终背离手掌和身体；小幅撬动后退出，再换相邻位置重复，不强行扭转。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "operation", "section_title": "开茶步骤", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::hard_tea", "chunk_sha256": "241c4b89b7d9bf727522347f13b2c4f591208c0be15f4036c41ffbd50c402adb", "content": "若阻力明显，不要敲击工具或朝身体方向加力。应退出后寻找新的自然缝隙，必要时改用更适合大块撬取的茶刀，并分多次操作。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "hard_tea", "section_title": "过紧时处理", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::cleaning", "chunk_sha256": "3741342c64270993333bf9ecb3a448313950601e67d2887be24f9e666431c94b", "content": "使用后清除茶屑，以柔软干布擦净并充分干燥，套好保护套后存放在儿童接触不到的位置。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "cleaning", "section_title": "清洁与储存", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1::warnings", "chunk_sha256": "01b9199f323e351d178a6edda7e03dfa86bceb6efc9b1b701b05629321d96269", "content": "工具尖锐，不可作为儿童用品，不得用手掌抵住尖端方向，不得用于撬茶之外的用途。发生刺伤时先停止操作并按实际伤情处理。", "manual_content_sha256": "76c4e70a93d2c30416c475ef59b1bb2c17f6a9d69b7564cd02f1203ac2f0fbea", "manual_id": "MANUAL-TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "TEA-KNIFE-NEEDLE-SET", "product_name": "茶针与茶刀", "section_id": "warnings", "section_title": "安全警告", "sku_id": "CONTEXT-SKU", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-DEV-000074", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::overview", "chunk_sha256": "22a0955b5db4696ec8a2dec9db097cb8e027ef67ebf2b5b2aa8d43431590ac23", "content": "本品为即食红枣，商品记录标注可开袋直接食用，无需再次烹煮。食用与保存仍以对应包装标识为准。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "overview", "section_title": "食用方式", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::before_eating", "chunk_sha256": "146c6875b990ec891acce7619349421834bfa7ab38df347c6f0a885e9c8ed1a7", "content": "检查包装是否完整并核对包装上的保质信息。开袋后若发现霉点、虫蛀、异常潮湿或明显异味，不要食用。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "before_eating", "section_title": "食用前检查", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::serving", "chunk_sha256": "88ab5c559e6aaa7d1a71117d6c93ebd48c75a18e9e8640f3228d6d43e89f14a5", "content": "使用清洁干燥的手或容器取食，取食后及时封口。儿童、老年人或吞咽能力受限者食用时应注意枣核和噎食风险。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "serving", "section_title": "取食", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::storage", "chunk_sha256": "09093e02bd0080a65a53f51a8a469b531fdceade9cf77b2b05f0e6fa92c5c43b", "content": "开封后密封，按包装标注的温度、避光条件和期限保存。说明书没有给出统一的开封后天数，不能脱离包装自行承诺。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "storage", "section_title": "开封后保存", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::abnormal", "chunk_sha256": "f1f0f6b569085f61b55493c9e2f05b63f8e13a66710eb567c3e09e14223bc3cf", "content": "产品出现霉变、酸败样异味、虫蛀或包装异常时应停止食用并保留商品与包装信息。已经食用后若出现持续不适，应及时咨询专业医务人员。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "abnormal", "section_title": "异常情况", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
{"chunk_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1::limits", "chunk_sha256": "f356f1dcd35e4ecdf25f0753dc82bfbd6c802663701080daab2a185c21b82805", "content": "本说明书不声称补血、治疗或其他保健功效，也不提供孕妇、慢性病患者或特定人群的个体化食用量建议。", "manual_content_sha256": "6c39ce5057a3f0ef0bcd37c230701a0736d29e014e7822726f4bd65a74de32aa", "manual_id": "MANUAL-READY-RED-DATE-345-V1", "manual_version": "1.0.0", "product_id": "READY-RED-DATE-345", "product_name": "即食红枣", "section_id": "limits", "section_title": "信息边界", "sku_id": "READY-TO-EAT", "snapshot_id": "GOLD-SNAP-SEMANTIC-GOLD-TRAIN-000345", "source": "synthetic_frozen_manual_v1"}
